{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And you shall take some of the blood that is on the altar.</b> We do not find a sprinkling like this to gather the blood after it has been thrown; rather, to affiliate them with the altar — he takes the blood that was consecrated on the altar. <b>And sprinkle it upon them.</b> As testimony and as a sign for generations that they are His attendants, and that strangers may not draw near to it."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:02.570227362Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}